findings.body:
In `WryWebviewDispatcher::delete_cookie`, the message was changed from `WebviewMessage::DeleteCookie` to `WebviewMessage::SetCookie`. That's the reverse of what the description asks for. The `DeleteCookie` arm in the event loop at `crates/tauri-runtime-wry/src/lib.rs` (around line 3737) now runs only for messages sent by code that isn't this method, so `delete_cookie` does the opposite of its name.

::diff{file="crates/tauri-runtime-wry/src/lib.rs" lines="1715-1721"}

The `.clone()` removal is fine on its own. It was the variant swap that broke the method. Any caller of `Webview::delete_cookie` or `WebviewWindow::delete_cookie` will now write the cookie into the webview.

::callout{type="warning"}
No test in this PR exercises `delete_cookie`. An end-to-end check that a cookie is gone after `delete_cookie` would have caught this.

`WebviewWindowBuilder::with_window_features` is renamed to `window_features` in `crates/tauri/src/webview/webview_window.rs`. The PR description doesn't mention it, and no `.changes` entry records it. If the method has shipped anywhere, the rename breaks callers at compile time. The `on_new_window` feature it supports appears to be unreleased, which limits the impact, but the rename should still be stated in the description and the change log. The `with_` prefix matches the rest of the builder API, so the rename also goes against the existing convention.

::diff{file="crates/tauri/src/webview/webview_window.rs" lines="1313-1316"}

If the rename is intended, say so and add a change file. If not, revert it and keep `with_window_features`, which the doc examples and the example app used before this PR.

The rewritten size and position calls have stray whitespace (`inner_size(size.width,    size.height)` and `position(position.x,position.y)`). Tauri CI runs `cargo fmt --check`, so this will fail. The PR also swaps the order of the size and position calls without explaining why. Both changes are unrelated to the three bullets in the description.

::diff{file="crates/tauri/src/webview/webview_window.rs" lines="1316-1321"}

::suggestion{file="crates/tauri/src/webview/webview_window.rs" lines="1316-1321"}
